          "story_heading_size": 40,
          "story_heading_align": "left",
          "story_body": "<p>We’re not a badge slapped on someone else’s wheels. Fortune Forged owns a stake in the factory that machines every set—so design, materials, finishing, and QC stay under one roof.</p><p>That means tighter control, clearer answers, and wheels that match what you ordered. From first sketch to final torque spec, the same team is accountable for how it looks and how it sits.</p>",
